            <li>附件【<a href="/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1370093333&wbfileid=53D6022351D4426EEB557CB22A8701E8" target="_blank">生源地信用助学贷款一次性还款计划书.docx</a>】已下载<span id="nattach6537151"><script language="javascript">getClickTimes(6537151,1370093333,"wbnewsfile","attach")</script></span>次</li>
            <li>附件【<a href="/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1370093333&wbfileid=09675B1D15F746832AD7E2F80836DFD2" target="_blank">应征入伍服兵役高等学校学生国家教育资助申请表2.docx</a>】已下载<span id="nattach6537155"><script language="javascript">getClickTimes(6537155,1370093333,"wbnewsfile","attach")</script></span>次</li>
        </UL>
    </p>
